ent-CP14GatherableBloodFlower = blood rose
    .desc = Scarlet flowers growing where blood has been spilled.
ent-CP14GatherableDayflin = yellow dayflin
    .desc = A yellow sun flower that smells like melted milk. Can be processed into a yellow dye.
ent-CP14GatherableSilverNeedle = silver needle
    .desc = Blue sharp shoots breaking through the snow, with bright orange berries. The ability of this plant to survive even in regions with severe frosts is simply amazing.
ent-CP14GatherableWildSage = wild sage
    .desc = Root of this ubiquitous medicinal plant not bad at healing physical injuries, and inducing coughing.
